# Buttondown email template — a DJANGO template, not HTML. Prettier's HTML
# parser fails on the `{# #}` and `{% if %}` tags, and reflowing the
# table-based email layout would break the inline styles Outlook depends on.
# The sibling .css/.md files in that directory ARE formatted normally.
/email/buttondown/template.html

# Chrome user-data dirs leaked into the repo root by chrome-launcher under
# WSL (literal `C:\Users\...\AppData\Local\lighthouse.NNNNNN` names). These
# are gitignored, so CI never sees them, but prettier reads .prettierignore
# rather than .gitignore and would otherwise fail `format:check` locally.
# Mirrors the /C:\\Users\\* pattern in .gitignore. `pnpm lhci` (via
# scripts/run-lhci.mjs) deletes them post-run.
/C:\\Users\\*
